        {
          "items": [
            "Premiere Properties would love to host you at Beach Music! It is truly a hidden gem! The home was just renovated and is newly designed by our professional Interior Design team! We are looking forward to your stay with us! <br><br>Beach Music is a haven for relaxation and rejuvenation for 18 guests. This home has a private heated pool and stunning views to the Gulf with a private Beach Access steps from this home. Plenty of room for your entire party. Fully stocked kitchen along with everything you may need to make wonderful memories.<br><br>Home Highlights:<br>-Private Beach Boardwalk directly beside home<br>-Outdoor dining & sitting area<br>-Private heated pool<br>-5 adult bikes included<br>-Recently renovated<br>-Flat screen, smart TV's in every bedroom<br>-Gourmet Gas Grill<br><br>First Floor: <br>-Bunk Room (Two twin over twin bunk beds)<br>-Bedroom (King Bedroom next to full bath) <br>-Sofa Pull Out (Queen)<br>-Access to pool<br><br>Second Floor:<br>-Kitchen <br>-Dining Area <br>-Living Room<br>-Half Bath <br><br>Third Floor:<br>-Master Bedroom (King bed with en-suite bathroom)<br>-Bedroom (King bed with Jack & Jill Bathroom)<br>-Bunkroom (Two sets of Twin over Twin Bunk Beds with 2 pull out twin beds)<br><br>Located in the heart of 30A!<br><br>Restaurants:<br>-Great Southern Cafe<br>-Angelina's Pizzeria & Pasta<br>-Café Thirty-A<br>-Cowgirl Kitchen Market<br>-Donut Hut<br>-Old Florida Fish House<br>-Seagrove Village Market Café<br>-Surfing Deer<br>-The Perfect Pig - Seagrove Beach<br><br>Guest access:<br>You will get a unique door code to you for the length of your stay.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
